msgstr "下载的内容不是 JSON 配置。"

msgid "The nodes follow the subscription of this profile; only their latency is tested here."
msgstr "节点来自这份配置的订阅，随订阅更新；这里只能测试延迟。"

msgid "The profile and its nodes, groups and rules are deleted."
msgstr "这份配置连同它的节点、策略组和规则都会删除。"

msgid "The profile does not exist."
msgstr "配置不存在。"

msgid "The profile in use cannot be deleted."
msgstr "使用中的配置文件不能删除。"

msgid "The profile, its groups and rules, and what its subscription downloaded are deleted."
msgstr "这份配置连同它的策略组、规则和订阅下载的内容都会删除。"

msgid "The rule applies when the condition does not match."
msgstr "条件不满足时规则生效。"

msgid "The sing-box_*_openwrt_%s.apk file from the sing-box release page."
msgstr "sing-box 发布页中的 sing-box_*_openwrt_%s.apk 文件。"

msgid "The sub-rule matches when its condition does not."
msgstr "条件不匹配时，这条子规则算匹配。"

msgid "This protocol always uses TLS."
msgstr "该协议必须使用 TLS。"

msgid "This rule has several conditions, set outside this page. Its action and comment can be changed here; its conditions stay as they are."
msgstr "这条规则有多个条件，是在页面之外设置的。这里可以改动作和注释，条件保持原样。"

